<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,590 packages of landed tea sold at this week's London sale was 150.14 pence a kilo against 151.07 last week and 107.69 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 127,435 pks sold so far this year is 129.50 pence against 111.03 pence for the 182,558 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
